Subject: [PATCH 3/3] BlueOS: iconloaderlib: 0.8 glyph role, readable plates,
 plate exactly like the widget cards
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

«Цвет значков» (glyph role), see-through plates made denser until the glyph reads 3:1 on the wallpaper, and blueos_icon_material = -2: the widget card colour, material and transparency, without the shadow showing through.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Change-Id: I96c9bd45982785214d0321920859fd4df6567b7d
---
